        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo ncobeni kuyoosika buzuba bupya mbuli ceengelo, elyo boonse balisumpula aboonse bacitazibi bayooba buungu. Buzuba obo buboola buyoobatenta, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu, akutabasiila nuuba muyanda nuuba mutabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
